Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.30,0:00:06.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arsenal. New season. Same bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.25,0:00:12.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This year, we finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.34,0:00:17.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I ordered a striker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:20.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Force of habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.89,0:00:23.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get me the striker. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.54,0:00:30.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So they bought a striker. Someone to finish the chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:38.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.14,0:00:40.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Win us a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:44.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not the goal! Off him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.94,0:00:51.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now we’re dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:01:02.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Their attacking philosophy? Win a corner. Somebody’s forehead will\Ndo the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.45,0:01:10.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,ONE–NIL! That’s enough football. Everybody back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.83,0:01:23.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lovely. A goalkeeper protecting nine defenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.97,0:01:26.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.47,0:01:28.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Win another corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.87,0:01:34.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nobody is getting past us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.87,0:01:37.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.37,0:01:44.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They could defend a one–nil. They couldn’t defend a lead on the\Ntable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.37,0:01:50.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He’s only walking. We’re fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.27,0:01:58.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,WHY IS HE WALKING?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.87,0:02:01.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Long season, Mikel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.57,0:02:07.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eyes forward! Nobody look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:10.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still delivering in May?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.97,0:02:12.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,NOT NOW!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.89,0:02:17.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep hold of the lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.09,0:02:23.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Penalty. Against Arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.97,0:02:27.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For a penalty against Arsenal, please hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.97,0:02:36.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mikel! Straight through, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:39.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you make that go away?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.46,0:02:44.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course. Would you like a corner with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:46.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make it two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:52.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello? I’m still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:55.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your call is very important to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.46,0:03:06.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One goal for the title. And of course, one bloody corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:10.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do I finally get to shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.87,0:03:12.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. Stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.39,0:03:16.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There’s still time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.27,0:03:24.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I’m supposed to be the stri—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:30.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That counts?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:32.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exactly as rehearsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:37.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So… who signs for these?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:39.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wrong address.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:42.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.96,0:03:46.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting. The season has now ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.68,0:04:04.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I SAID I WAS RETIRED! STOP GIVING ME REASONS TO COME BACK!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.17,0:01:38.67,Result,,0,0,0,,CITY WIN
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.67,0:01:55.67,Result,,0,0,0,,CITY WIN
